<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Proposal No. 2 - Ratification of the appointment by the Board of the Company of Cherry Bekaert LLP as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December&#160;31, 2024</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Company&#8217;s stockholders ratified the appointment of Cherry Bekaert LLP as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December&#160;31, 2024. The voting results were as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

