<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Proposal No. 4 - Approval of the Issuance of Shares</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved the issuance of shares of common stock upon the exercise of the warrants issued by the Company to investors and the placement agent, dated as of May&#160;1, 2024, as required by and in accordance with Nasdaq Listing Rule&#160;5635(d). The voting results were as follows:</p>

